OL,3,GNEWSANephew wants change after killings
OL,4,Aof uncles                              
OL,6,FA nephew of twin brothers killed by a  
OL,7,Fman suffering a psychotic episode who  
OL,8,Fwas released from custody hours before 
OL,9,Fsays he has little confidence similar  
OL,10,Fcases could be prevented.              
OL,12,FThe deaths of Roger and Dick Carter,   
OL,13,Fboth 84, and Anthony Payne, 80, in     
OL,14,FExeter by Alexander Lewis-Ranwell on 10
OL,15,FFebruary 2019 followed a catalogue of  
OL,16,Ffailings by police, healthcare         
OL,17,Fprofessionals and G4S-employed staff,  
OL,18,Fan inquest jury found.                 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
